manifest={'schemaVersion':1,'id':'academy','sourceChapter':'chapter-04','status':'proposed','title':{'ru':'Академия Леса','en':'The Forest Academy','es':'La academia del bosque'},'summary':{'ru':'Одна прогулка учит друзей прислушиваться. После уроков у старого дуба хватает времени для истории, венка и тихой дружбы.','en':'One listening walk helps the friends notice their forest. After class, there is time for a story, a flower crown and quiet friendship beneath the oak.','es':'Un paseo para escuchar ayuda a los amigos a descubrir su bosque. Después de clase hay tiempo para una historia, una corona de flores y la amistad bajo el roble.'},'cover':{},'preproduction':[{'id':'cast','title':'Canonical cast','src':'images/chapter-04-academy/preproduction/cast-v1.png','description':'PinPin, Lulu, Tutu and proposed owl teacher; internally reviewed identity study.'},{'id':'site','title':'Academy site','src':'images/chapter-04-academy/preproduction/site-v1.png','description':'Pavilion left, stream left, stump center, snag rear, oak right; geography reference.'},{'id':'oak','title':'Oak root clean plate','src':'images/chapter-04-academy/preproduction/oak-plate-v1.png','description':'Three dry root hollows, daisies left, southeast departure path.'}],'sequences':[{'id':x[0],'title':dict(zip(['ru','en','es'],x[1:])),'purpose':'Expand physical and emotional continuity through distinct actions and reactions.'} for x in seq],'scenes':[], 'editorialNotes':['Original chapter4 repeats the same seven-beat afternoon passage twice; adapted once.','Ordinary later school day, not the morning after chapter3 or first-ever school day.','Owl teacher, outdoor academy and listening walk are adaptation additions.','Raccoon anecdote has a newly written gentle punch line and stays an orally told story, not a flashback.','Daisy gathering/weaving stages and home threshold expand compressed source actions.'], 'continuityNotes':['Elder’s next-dawn invitation remains a future story thread, not depicted or cancelled here.','Lulu is rabbit, Tutu squirrel; established PinPin and Mama identities.','School garden consistent landmark geography; no invented interior used.','Lulu retains the crown at the oak; PinPin and Mama go home without it.']}
